==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Simply bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], any [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] or the [[Ototo Corps|Breakerblast Cannon]]. That and a stable stream of [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cats]], assuming you have the first two [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], will do the job.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
By knocking back Corporal Weyland once, an [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can take down Le'Solar on its own. If this doesn't work, a steady stream of sufficiently leveled [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Mk II]] can permanently stall all enemies if they don't get hit by Ribbo.

This stage can cause immediate trouble if not dealt with quickly. A Barrier Breaker is extremely helpful to the stage as all three enemies heavily rely on their [[Barrier]]s for protection. [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kitty of Liberty]] is the ideal choice (in its [[True Form]]), alongside [[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Macho Legs Cat]], [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Major Leaguer Cat]]. Bring some melee units that can take hits from Le'Solar such as [[Li'l Fish Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], and a rusher for the beginning. As the enemies approach, send a rusher to bait Le'Solar's attack. and then proceed to send your Barrier Breaker. They should hopefully be able to destroy both Le'Solar and Weyland's Barriers. Start sending out your melee units and it should be quite easy.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This stage is not as difficult as it seems. Just bring any unit Defense Up [[Cat Combo]]s, [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kitty of Liberty]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and any sort of rusher (such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]]) that can land a few hits on Project A. Start by levelling up worker cat once, then spam Catellite until you can send out Kitty of Liberty to break Le'Solar's barrier. Keep spamming Catellite and save up money. Once you have enough, send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. It will take out Le'Solar and deal decent damage to both Project As before dying. Keep spamming Catellite and wait for another Awakened Bahamut Cat to beat the level. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] may help by blocking waves from Axoloty, but it is not required. All units should be at least level 30 for a guaranteed victory.

