==Trivia==
*Kaiou's name is derived from the character King Kai from ''Dragon Ball Z'', which in Japnese is ''Kaiou''.
**On the enemy base is a snake, referencing Snake Way in ''Dragon Ball Z'', and the purple orbs are the One-, Two-, and Five-star Dragon Balls.
**The planet on the map resembles King Kai's gravity-heavy planet.
**The stage's [[Treasure]] is Dad Jokes, of which King Kai is known to make plenty.
*The enemy base's design is significantly changed from the original chapter 3 in [[The Battle Cats POP!]], in which it has a blue overall color scheme with green, unstarred "Dragon Balls". The stage's name was also shortened from '''Planet Kaiou''', which remains as its name in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]].

